      "dcterms:title": "The Stokes phenomenon for the Ramanujan’s q -diﬀerence equation and its higher order extension",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "MORITA∗, Takeshi"
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20220422",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1404.2541",
      "dcterms:abstract": "We show connection formulae of local solutions of the Ramanu- jan equation between the origin and the inﬁnity. These solutions are given by the Ramanujan function, the q-Airy function and the diver- gent basic hypergeometric series 2ϕ0(0, 0; −; q, x). We use two diﬀerent q-Borel-Laplace resummation methods to obtain our connection for- mulae. We also introduce the q-Borel-Laplace transformation of level r−1, which are higher order extension of these transformations. These methods are useful to obtain an asymptotic formula of a divergent se- ries rϕ0(0, 0, . . . , 0; −; q, x).",
      "dcterms:source": "library/arxiv-1404.2541v1/manifest.jsonld",
      "dcterms:hasVersion": "library/arxiv-1404.2541v1"
    }
  ]
